-wellness-report-2025/" type="primary" target="_self" class="sc-1fb90aaf-47 eIwhw"><div class="sc-9addcfcc-27 czwqXz"><div class="sc-1fb90aaf-107 sc-9addcfcc-2 dRhGvh gmHaya"><div class="sc-9addcfcc-1 KzpQj"><picture class="sc-841363ad-0 hGAKsc"><source srcSet="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/US_CW_Meta_Image_315dd8c0be.png?w=460&amp;h=240&amp;q=65" media="(max-width: 360px)" height="100%"/><source srcSet="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/US_CW_Meta_Image_315dd8c0be.png?w=460&amp;h=240&amp;q=65" media="(max-width: 480px)" height="100%"/><img src="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/US_CW_Meta_Image_315dd8c0be.png?w=460&amp;h=240&amp;q=65" alt="" height="240" width="460" loading="lazy" class="sc-9addcfcc-0 knpgvy"/></picture></div></div></div></a><div class="sc-9addcfcc-22 bmIrfC"><a href="https://wellhub.com/en-us/resources/corporate-wellness-report-2025/" type="primary" target="_self" class="sc-1fb90aaf-47 eIwhw"><h2 class="sc-1fb90aaf-6 exDJsL">Wellhub | Corporate Wellness Report 2025</h2></a><p class="sc-1fb90aaf-2 hQQBen">Our exclusive study explores how corporate partnerships drive membership, retention, and profitability for fitness or wellness business owners.</p></div></div><div class="sc-9addcfcc-28 kDtzYr"><a href="https://wellhub.com/en-us/blog/wellness-and-benefits-programs/open-enrollment-guide/" type="primary" target="_self" class="sc-1fb90aaf-47 eIwhw"><div class="sc-9addcfcc-27 czwqXz"><div class="sc-1fb90aaf-107 sc-9addcfcc-2 dRhGvh gmHaya"><div class="sc-9addcfcc-1 KzpQj"><picture class="sc-841363ad-0 hGAKsc"><source srcSet="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/Wellhub_Office_08_7319a1bcf7.jpg?w=460&amp;h=240&amp;q=65" media="(max-width: 360px)" height="100%"/><source srcSet="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/Wellhub_Office_08_7319a1bcf7.jpg?w=460&amp;h=240&amp;q=65" media="(max-width: 480px)" height="100%"/><img src="https://assets-cdn.wellhub.com/images/mep-cms/Wellhub_Office_08_7319a1bcf7