 aria-hidden="true" class="sc-841363ad-0 iTrXPQ"><path d="M11.293 4.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l7 7a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-5.293-5.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><div class="sc-841363ad-0 cAPTJs"><a href="#wellbeing_roi" class="sc-1fb90aaf-12 fmWrMN">¹ Client case study</a><p class="sc-1fb90aaf-8 bcvHgT">Internal study conducted by Wellhub with global clients to understand increase in workforce physical activity over 3 years.</p></div></li><li class="sc-e2fabbb5-13 jUrElz"><a href="#wellbeing_roi" aria-label="² Healthcare study with retail client" class="sc-e2fabbb5-14 cFevAq"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="sc-841363ad-0 iTrXPQ"><path d="M11.293 4.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l7 7a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-5.293-5.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><div class="sc-841363ad-0 cAPTJs"><a href="#wellbeing_roi" class="sc-1fb90aaf-12 fmWrMN">² Healthcare study with retail client</a><p class="sc-1fb90aaf-8 bcvHgT">Wellhub internal study with a Brazilian client, January 2019-May 2022; surveyed ‘moderate and above’ users with &gt;5 check-ins/mo</p></div></li><li class="sc-e2fabbb5-13 jUrElz"><a href="#wellbeing_roi" aria-label="³ Internal retention study" class="sc-e2fabbb5-14 cFevAq"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="sc-841363ad-0 iTrXPQ"><path d="M11.293 4.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l7 7a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-5.293-5.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><div class="sc-841363ad-0 cAPTJs"><a href="#wellbeing_roi" class="sc-1fb90aaf-12 fmWrMN">³ Internal retention study</a><p class="sc-1fb90aaf-8 bcvHgT">Average results of an internal study conducted with 3 clients over a 2-year 